---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | SecondServe">
  <main class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> November 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Compliance Statement (NFR-BUS-LC-3)</h2>
    <p>
      SecondServe processes personal information in accordance with the Philippine Data Privacy
      Act of 2012 (Republic Act No. 10173). By creating an account or placing an order, you
      consent to the collection and use of your information as described below.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account & Profile Data:</strong> Full name, email address, phone number, role (Buyer, Seller, Partner, Administrator), and hashed authentication credentials managed by Supabase Auth.</li>
      <li><strong>Seller & Partner Verification Records:</strong> Business names, business addresses, organization types, and accreditation documents (e.g., DTI/business permits, DSWD registration, LGU IDs).</li>
      <li><strong>Transaction & Order Data:</strong> Purchased or claimed listings, quantities, order statuses, simulated payment statuses, and distribution logs.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How Delivery Addresses Are Handled (FR-SYS-13, NFR-SYS-S-2)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Collection & Purpose:</strong> Default and order-specific delivery addresses are collected solely to calculate delivery fees, dispatch orders, and complete fulfillment for Buyers and Partners selecting delivery.</li>
      <li><strong>Controlled Sharing:</strong> Your delivery address and contact number are shared only with the fulfilling Seller and the assigned delivery service partner (simulated in the prototype) for active delivery orders.</li>
      <li><strong>Security & Access Control:</strong> All personal and address records are encrypted in transit (TLS 1.2+) and at rest (AES-256), with strict role-based access controls preventing unauthorized cross-user access.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Data Retention & User Rights (NFR-USER-R-3)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Account and transaction records are retained for at least two (2) years following last activity to support order history, dispute resolution, audit logging, and BIR tax compliance reporting.</li>
      <li>You may update your profile details and saved delivery addresses at any time via your Profile page, or request account deactivation through Platform Administrators.</li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }
</style>